; resonance-ir — resonance as graph motion dynamics
; one of the pratibimba (renderer) family.
; translates satya, pass energy, and relation flow into animation fields.
; consumed by Raylib for node pulse, edge flow, camera breath.
; shares thaalam timing grid with music-ir.

(bhasha resonance-ir
  (yukta pratibimba satya avrti thaalam resonance-ir-setu)
  (swarupa setu)
  (phala spanda)
  (sthita domain-sangeetham domain-language))
